WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.749
Logging in

00:00:05.799 --> 00:00:11.523
Open the application in your browser. Type your username on the login page.

00:00:13.548 --> 00:00:15.732
Then type your password.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:22.064
Press Sign In. You land on your dashboard.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.175
You are logged in
